and.\nErn/MM23.lean:601:37: error: Tactic `rewrite` failed: Did not find an occurrence of the pattern\n  pl.owner\nin the target expression\n  FrameGone s.F (Holder.place p✝)\n\ns : S3\nq : Nat\npl : Place\nhu : s.Usable q\nhpl : s.P[q]? = some pl\nthis : HolderLive s pl.owner\np✝ : Nat\nho : pl.owner = Holder.place p✝\nh : FrameGone s.F (Holder.place p✝)\n⊢ False\nErn/MM23.lean:720:8: error: Tactic `assumption` failed\n\ncase h_1\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/MM23.lean 2>&1  0.80s user 0.19s system 147% cpu 0.676 total\nhead -70  0.00s user 0.00s system 0% cpu 0.665 total","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"480bb3e3-7c91-4c36-aff9-21b00a6900d5","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:31:50.426Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Ern/MM23.lean:474:21: error: Application type mismatch: The argument\n  is\nhas type\n  List Nat\nbut is expected to have type\n  Placement\nin the application\n  allocOps_old is\nErn/MM23.lean:470:27: error: unsolved goals\npl : Placement\ng : Nat → Geom\nfa : Option Nat\nk : Nat\nis : List Nat\ns : MM02.State\n⊢ (exec (s.alloc (g k).space (pl s (g k)) (g k).size (g k).align fa)\n          (allocOps pl g fa (s.alloc (g k).space (pl s (g k)) (g k).size (g k).align fa) is)).allocs\n      (s.next + 0) =\n    some\n      { space := (g k).space, base := pl s (g k), size := (g k).size, align := (g k).align, live := true,\n        bytes := fun x => MM02.AByte.uninit, freeAuth := fa }\nErn/MM23.lean:531:59: error: omega could not prove the goal:\na possible counterexample may satisfy the constraints\n  c ≥ 0\n  b ≥ 0\n  a ≥ 0\n  a - b ≥ 1\n  a - b + c ≥ 1\nwhere\n a := ↑P.length\n b := ↑r\n c := ↑ls.length\nErn/MM23.lean:581:2: error(lean.synthInstanceFailed): failed to synthesize instance of type class\n  Decidable\n    ((∀ (j : Nat),\n        j < roots.length →\n          OptP roots[j]?\n            (fun i =>\n              ∀ (l : Nat), l ∈ footprint P' (n + i) → (L l).alloc = next + j ∧ (L l).off + (L l).len ≤ (g i).size)\n            True) ∧\n      ∀ (l : Nat),\n        l < P'.length →\n          ∀ (l' : Nat),\n            l' < P'.length →\n              n ≤ l →\n                n ≤ l' →\n                  isLeaf P' l →\n                    isLeaf P' l' →\n                      l ≠ l' →\n                        (L l).alloc = (L l').alloc → MM02.RangeDisjoint (L l).off (L l).len (L l').off (L l').len)\n\nHint: Type class instance resolution failures can be inspected with the `set_option trace.Meta.synthInstance true` command.\nErn/MM23.lean:601:37: error: Tactic `rewrite` failed: Did not find an occurrence of the pattern\n  pl.owner\nin the target expression\n  FrameGone s.F (Holder.place p✝)\n\ns : S3\nq : Nat\npl : Place\nhu : s.Usable q\nhpl : s.P[q]? = some pl\nthis : HolderLive s pl.owner\np✝ : Nat\nho : pl.owner = Holder.place p✝\nh : FrameGone s.F (Holder.place p✝)\n⊢ False\nErn/MM23.lean:720:8: error: Tactic `assumption` failed\n\ncase h_1\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/MM23.lean 2>&1  0.80s user 0.19s system 147% cpu 0.676 total\nhead -70  0.00s user 0.00s system 0% cpu 0.665 total","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c47d42ca-de5e-4245-8bfe-0d7de2444a30","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/refinement_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6be4bd19-edff-4193-b4ae-502d97a1fe4d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","s