{"parentUuid":"00912fe3-8fde-4b3f-94e1-56155dabe470","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgausmnwsqnNeAmDPKcVk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The theorem reviewer reports two major and two minor findings, none blocking. I'm acting on them while the `Repr` reviewer finishes:\n- **F1** (a local owned by a local leaks at exit) is already question (e) 1 with a witness. I'll also say so in the `exitOps` docstring.\n- **F2**: storage owned by a freed root keeps a live allocation. K4 only says `free ↦ DeallocStep`, so this is a reading, not a consequence. I'll add a witness and an arbitration question.\n- **F4**: `FreeSound` quantifies over every pair (place, authority) when `r6_free` uses only the freed one. I'll narrow it to that pair, which strengthens the theorem."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3917,"cache_read_input_tokens":638195,"output_tokens":1514,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1038},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3917,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1514,"cache_read_input_tokens":638195,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3917,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3917},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3b90dfc3-3139-4aeb-8b58-a8f681a4208a","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgausmVbVKEbSmEiY2CQU","requestRef":"a2946012-b7c6-43fb-bf93-8775daff283a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0b67072b-087a-4bbc-8d25-6b3812d71160","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:03:05.645Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh"