{"parentUuid":"eaaa213e-f23b-4392-957f-45cf339bc500","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgautuKfng8qYP7DRk2Lk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011gTFsXgGfanabhjYrJSy4G","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/MM23.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\nold_fs=s[s.index(\"/-- MM-03.3.8 (`Deallocable`, `FreeCompat`) and K4\"):s.index(\"/-- K2: the token proper to each frame\")]\nnew_fs='''/-- MM-03.3.8 (`Deallocable`, `FreeCompat`) and K4 (\"`free` ↦ `DeallocStep`, autorité\n`Compatible` issue de `FreeCompat`\"): obligation of the contracts towards MM-02 for `free p auth` in\nthe state `s2`: when the contracts permit it, every leaf of `p` is in an allocation with a token\ncompatible with `auth` (MM-02.D). -/\ndef FreeSound (k : K) (C : Nat → Nat → Prop) (L : Layout) (s3 : S3) (s2 : MM02.State)\n    (p auth : Nat) : Prop :=\n  k.Deallocable p → k.FreeCompat p auth → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P p,\n    AllocP s2 (L l).alloc fun a => ∃ d, a.freeAuth = some d ∧ C auth d\n\n'''\ns=s.replace(old_fs,new_fs)\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    (hwf : WF3 s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (hfs : FreeSound k C L s3 s2)\n    (h : FreeStep k p auth s3 (.ok s3')) :\"\"\",\"\"\"    (hwf : WF3 s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (hfs : FreeSound k C L s3 s2 p auth)\n    (h : FreeStep k p auth s3 (.ok s3')) :\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    exact (hR.live p hpr.1 hpr hu _ hl0).and (hfs p auth hdl hfc _ hl0)\"\"\",\"\"\"    exact (hR.live p hpr.1 hpr hu _ hl0).and (hfs hdl hfc _ hl0)\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  refine r6_free (k := KC) (auth := 7) (reachable_invariants kc_dd r12).1 (by decide) ?_\n    (.ok (by decide))\n  intro p auth hp hc l hl\n  have hfp : footprint e12.P 6 = [6] := by decide\n  simp only [KC, List.mem_cons, Prod.mk.injEq, List.not_mem_nil, or_false] at hp hc\n  obtain ⟨rfl, rfl⟩ := hc\n  rw [hfp, List.mem_singleton] at hl; subst hl\"\"\",\"\"\"  refine r6_free (k := KC) (auth := 7) (reachable_invariants kc_dd r12).1 (by decide) ?_\n    (.ok (by decide))\n  intro _ _ l hl\n  have hfp : footprint e12.P 6 = [6] := by decide\n  rw [hfp, List.mem_singleton] at hl; subst hl\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"- `leaked`: a root owned by a place, not usable and not freed keeps its allocation live (K3: dead\n  by `endUse`; K4: owned storage that dies with a frame or with a freed root is not deallocated).\"\"\",\"\"\"- `leaked`: a root owned by a place, not usable and not freed keeps its allocation live. K3 says\n  it of a root dead by `endUse`; the clause also covers owned storage that dies with its frame (K4:\n  no `DeallocStep` for it) or with a freed root (K4 read as one `DeallocStep`, of the freed root):\n  report, (c) 4 and (e) 7.\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"/-- K4 (`exitFrame` ↦ one `DeallocStep` per automatic allocation of the frame, none for the owned\nstorage that dies with it): the deallocations of the allocations of the root places owned by the\ncurrent frame, with its token (K2). -/\"\"\",\"\"\"/-- K4 (`exitFrame` ↦ one `DeallocStep` per automatic allocation of the frame, none for the owned\nstorage that dies with it): the deallocations of the allocations of the root places owned by the\ncurrent frame, with its token (K2). A local owned by another local is read as owned storage: no\ndeallocation (report, (c) 3 and (e) 1; witness `CaseOwnedLocal`). -/\"\"\")\nadd='''/-- Witness of question (e) 7 of the report: the storage 7, allocated with owner the storage 6,\ndies with the `free` of 6 (O13); `free` has one `DeallocStep`, of the allocation 4 of 6, and the\nallocation 5 of 7 stays live; deallocating it too breaks `Repr` (clause `leaked`). -/\ndef ao13 : S3 := allocEff e12 1 6 [(none, none, 0)]\ndef af14 : S3 := freeEff ao13 6\ntheorem ra13 : Reachable KC st ao13 :=\n  .alloc r12 (.ok (by decide) (by decide) : AllocStep KC 1 6 [(none, none, 0)] e12 (.ok ao13))\ntheorem ra14 : Reachable KC st af14 := .free ra13 (.ok (by decide) : FreeStep KC 6 7 ao13 (.ok af14))\ndef La : Layout := fun q => if q = 7 then ⟨5, 0, 4⟩ else L q\ndef na13 : MM02.State := exec m12 [.alloc 0 (topPlacement m12 (g 0)) 8 4 (some 7)]\ndef na14 : MM02.State := exec na13 (deallocOps [rootAlloc La ao13.P 6] 7)\nexample : Repr tk La ao13 na13 ∧ Repr tk La af14 na14 := by decide\nexample : ¬ af14.Usable 7 ∧ af14.freed 7 = false ∧ LiveAlloc na14 5 ∧ DeadAlloc na14 4 := by decide\nexample : ¬ Repr tk La af14 (na14.dealloc 5) := by decide\n\nend Cases\n'''\ns=s.replace(\"end Cases\\n\", add, 1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"FreeSound\" Ern/MM23.lean | head; ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/MM23.lean 2>&1 | head -20","description":"Narrow FreeSound, add the free-owner witness, update docstrings"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2646,"cache_read_input_tokens":642112,"output_tokens":2879,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":600},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2646,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2879,"cache_read_input_tokens":642112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2646,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2646},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_011gTFsXgGfanabhjYrJSy4G":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/MM23.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\nold_fs=s[s.index(\"/-- MM-03.3.8 (`Deallocable`, `FreeCompat`) and K4\"):s.index(\"/-- K2: the token proper to each frame\")]\nnew_fs='''/-- MM-03.3.8 (`Deallocable`, `FreeCompat`) and K4 (\"`free` ↦ `DeallocStep`, autorité\n`Compatible` issue de `FreeCompat`\"): obligation of t