   ¬ MM02.ReadStep obR (leafAcc m3 L .read 1) m3 .ub :=\n  r1_read3 (reachable_invariants kc_dd r3).1 (reachable_invariants kc_dd r3).2.1.nd\n    (reachable_fpLeaves_frameOwnedLive kc_dd r3).1 (by decide)\n    (.ok (by decide) : Read3Step 1 [1] e3 (.ok e3)) (fun _ _ => trivial) (fun l hl => by\n      rw [List.mem_singleton] at hl; subst hl; show (leafAcc m3 L .read 1).addr % 4 = 0; decide)\n    1 (List.mem_singleton_self _)\n\n/-- Gap kept (report, (f) 4): after `free` of 6, the storage 7 it owns stops being usable but is\nnot marked dead, where O13 marks dead \"le stockage qui cesse de vivre\". -/\nexample : af14.dead 7 = false ∧ ¬ af14.Usable 7 := by decide\n\nend Cases\n'''\ns=s.replace(\"end Cases\\n\", add, 1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/MM23.lean 2>&1 | head -20","description":"Add K1 (a)/(c) negative tests, direct R1 witness, O13 gap"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01PDMVAQEofws9H9ojaEXPaW":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"ae4961a4-d8bf-4422-947e-cc855e3e13dd","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgauvoWEBxX4P4dLFM1dM","requestRef":"04f30952-a3dc-4271-ade9-d304d4c52ce3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"01b5bd0c-45d9-478e-8761-eede0c90f008","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:04:20.010Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
