{"parentUuid":"56849e9c-523e-4f5f-ab68-339c4dbcadc3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgaw5CQUHYZfkGYLDFAdR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XnusGWo69XG2V7eg6LQ6Vo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='reports/MM23_v0.1.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"   `dec` et `stat` (K5). Aucun `K` concret n'en est dérivé, hors des cas de test. En particulier, rien n'établit ni ne\n   conserve `FreeSound` le long des pas : `r6_alloc` laisse libre le jeton `fa` de l'allocation\n   créée.\"\"\",\"\"\"   `dec` et `stat` (K5). Aucun `K` concret n'en est dérivé, hors des cas de test. En\n   particulier, rien n'établit ni ne conserve `FreeSound` le long des pas : `r6_alloc` laisse\n   libre le jeton `fa` de l'allocation créée.\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncd .. && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1: report verification fixes\n\nWhy: a verification workflow (4 lenses, one skeptic per finding)\nconfirmed 10 of 15 findings on the report and the review fixes.\n\nWhat:\n- Report: summary limited to what is proved on reached states, open\n  obligations listed; six draft gaps with their bearing on R1/R2/R6;\n  (b) MM-02 hypotheses per theorem; (c) 1 without the false linter\n  argument; (c) 4 and (e) 7: requiring a live allocation for owned storage\n  dying with its frame or freed root is a choice.\n- Module: R2 witness for the write of leaf 2; Cases.eX (owned storage\n  dying at exitFrame keeps a live allocation); Lsa's fresh allocation\n  carries the frame token; DraftGaps.wf_noRoot and wf_cyc (draft WF3\n  accepts a usable root without root authority and an ownership cycle).\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; the 153\ntheorem constants of the module use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the report verification fixes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1057,"cache_read_input_tokens":702364,"output_tokens":995,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":120},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1057,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":995,"cache_read_input_tokens":702364,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1057,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1057},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01XnusGWo69XG2V7eg6LQ6Vo":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='reports/MM23_v0.1.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"   `dec` et `stat` (K5). Aucun `K` concret n'en est dérivé, hors des cas de test. En particulier, rien n'établit ni ne\n   conserve `FreeSound` le long des pas : `r6_alloc` laisse libre le jeton `fa` de l'allocation\n   créée.\"\"\",\"\"\"   `dec` et `stat` (K5). Aucun `K` concret n'en est dérivé, hors des cas de test. En\n   particulier, rien n'établit ni ne conserve `FreeSound` le long des pas : `r6_alloc` laisse\n   libre le jeton `fa` de l'allocation créée.\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncd .. && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1: report verification fixes\n\nWhy: a verification workflow (4 lenses, one skeptic per finding)\nconfirmed 10 of 15 findings on the report and the review fixes.\n\nWhat:\n- Report: summary limited to what is proved on reached states, open\n  obligations listed; six draft gaps with their bearing on R1/R2/R6;\n  (b) MM-02 hypotheses per theorem; (c) 1 without the false linter\n  argument; (c) 4 and (e) 7: requiring a live allocation for owned storage\n  dying with its frame or freed root is a choice.\n- Module: R2 witness for the write of leaf 2; Cases.eX (owned storage\n  dying at exitFrame keeps a live allocation); Lsa's fresh allocation\n  carries the frame token; DraftGaps.wf_noRoot and wf_cyc (draft WF3\n  accepts a usable root without root authority and an ownership cycle).\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; the 153\ntheorem constants of the module use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the report verification fixes"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01XnusGWo69XG2V7eg6LQ6Vo":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"60a02798-add6-469a-9e67-ca097abf271c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgaw5C1AWgDeHPRhdUVei","requestRef":"f795209f-fed0-4ad4-be21-776f5aaf7be7","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8e7b1723-08eb-4f5b-9d15-2ac8ed46cbf3","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:18:43.161Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"parentUuid":"8e7b1723-08eb-4f5b-9d15-2ac8ed46cbf3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9a916e16-61ce-465a-8d9a-4586ef4170cf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XnusGWo69XG2V7eg6LQ6Vo","type":"tool_result","content":"332a8b3 MM23 pass 1: report verification fixes","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c383509e-e03f-4b8f-a229-d67ba4dcf309","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:18:51.661Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"332a8b3 MM23 pass 1: report verification fixes","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":239,"oldLines":9,"newStart":239,"newLines":9,"lines":["    des séquences n'est pas énoncée ; seule `WF` est propagée (`exec_wf`). R6 n'en a pas besoin."," 4. **Obligations ouvertes.** `FreeSound`, `PlacementOK`, `NewLayout` et `TokCompat` restent des","    hypothèses, de même que, côté MM-02, `MM02.WF` (propagé par `exec_wf` mais supposé au départ),","-   `dec` et `stat` (K5). Aucun `K` concret n'en est dérivé, hors des cas de test. En particulier, rien n'établit ni ne","-   conserve `FreeSound` le long des pas : `r6_alloc` laisse libre le jeton `fa` de l'allocation","-   créée. La justification de `FreeCompat` demandée par MM-03.3 §9.1.4 reste donc ouverte.","+   `dec` et `stat` (K5). Aucun `K` concret n'en est dérivé, hors des cas de test. En","+   particulier, rien n'établit ni ne conserve `FreeSound` le long des pas : `r6_alloc` laisse","+   libre le jeton `fa` de l'allocation créée. La justification de `FreeCompat` demandée par MM-03.3 §9.1.4 reste donc ouverte."," 5. **Blocs d'arène.** La sous-plage d'un bloc d'arène n'a pas d'énoncé propre : `issue` est hors","    passe, et un bloc n'est qu'une liste de feuilles du stockage."," 6. **`DDSound` réel, adresses épinglées, concurrence.** Hors périmètre de la passe."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"60a02798-add6-469a-9e67-ca097abf271c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/refinement_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8e7b1723-08eb-4f5b-9d15-2ac8ed46cbf3","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
