{"parentUuid":"1ada00d4-75ea-426f-be5e-23b4c36c02df","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"afea6d65-2af9-420c-969b-b55d07c96f18","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018idFkx1m6yL88cSuzPjRPw","type":"tool_result","content":"      73\n7:Representation of the abstract states of MM-03.3 (module `Ern.MM03`) by the states of the abstract\n74:/-! ## Representation relation (K2, K3) -/\n91:/-- K3, relation of representation `Repr` between an MM-03 state `s3` and an MM-02 state `s2`, for\n105:`Repr` does not read the contracts `K`: no clause of K3 depends on them. -/\n106:structure Repr (tok : Nat → Nat) (L : Layout) (s3 : S3) (s2 : MM02.State) : Prop where\n127:    Decidable (Repr tok L s3 s2) :=\n369:/-! ## Transport of `Repr` -/\n377:/-- `Repr` carries over when the MM-02 state only keeps its allocations (`Dom`) and the MM-03 state\n380:theorem Repr.change {tok : Nat → Nat} {L : Layout} {s3 s3' : S3} {s2 s2' : MM02.State}\n381:    (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (hd : Dom s2 s2') (hP : s3'.P = s3.P) (hF : s3'.F = s3.F)\n385:    Repr tok L s3' s2' := by\n450:`ok`, and the states where those leaves are `Init` stay in `Repr`, under `dec` along the\n455:    ∀ (ls : List Nat) (s3 : S3) (s2 : MM02.State), Repr tok L s3 s2 →\n459:        Repr tok L (write3Eff s3 ls) (exec s2 (writeOps s2 L w ls))\n469:    have hR₁ : Repr tok L (write3Eff s3 [l]) s2₁ := by\n491:    · show Repr tok L _ (exec (Op2.eff _ s2) _); rw [e₁]; exact this.2\n651:/-- K2, K3: `Repr` carries over when new places, a shape appended after the old ones, receive one\n657:    {fa : Option Nat} (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (hwf : MM02.WF s2)\n668:    Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (allocOps pl g fa s2 (rootIdx ls))) := by\n826:/-- `Repr` holds trivially for a state without places. -/\n828:    (h : s3.P.length = 0) : Repr tok L s3 s2 :=\n850:/-- `repr_init` (K3): the initial state `S3.init statics` is in `Repr` with the MM-02 state obtained\n864:      Repr tok L (S3.init statics) (exec MM02.State.empty (initOps pl g tok L w statics)) := by\n872:  have hR1 : Repr tok L (S3.init st0)\n928:    (hnd : NoDangling s3) (hfl : FpLeaves s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) {a : Nat} {y : Authority}\n947:the root, authority `read`): under `Repr`, `WF3`, `NoDangling` and `FpLeaves`, an `ok` read of\n953:    (hfl : FpLeaves s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (h : Read3Step a ls s3 (.ok s3'))\n978:`write`): under `Repr`, `WF3`, `NoDangling` and `FpLeaves`, an `ok` write of MM-03 gives writes of\n979:MM-02 of outcome `ok`, and the arrival states are in `Repr`, whatever the bytes `w` written.\n984:    (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (h : Write3Step a ls s3 (.ok s3')) (hstat : ∀ s ac w, ObW.stat s ac w)\n986:    AllOk C ObR ObW s2 (writeOps s2 L w ls) ∧ Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (writeOps s2 L w ls)) := by\n997:    (hfl : FpLeaves s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (h : WriteSharedStep k a ls s3 (.ok s3'))\n999:    AllOk C ObR ObW s2 (writeOps s2 L w ls) ∧ Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (writeOps s2 L w ls)) := by\n1269:    (hr : Reachable k statics s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (h : Read3Step a ls s3 (.ok s3'))\n1281:    (hdd : DDSound k) (hr : Reachable k statics s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2)\n1284:    AllOk C ObR ObW s2 (writeOps s2 L w ls) ∧ Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (writeOps s2 L w ls)) :=\n1292:    (hdd : DDSound k) (hr : Reachable k statics s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2)\n1295:    AllOk C ObR ObW s2 (writeOps s2 L w ls) ∧ Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (writeOps s2 L w ls)) :=\n1383:/-- K3: `Repr` carries over when the places, the stack and the `freed` marks do not change, no\n1385:theorem Repr.shrink {tok : Nat → Nat} {L : Layout} {s3 s3' : S3} {s2 : MM02.State}\n1386:    (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (hP : s3'.P = s3.P) (hF : s3'.F = s3.F) (hfr : s3'.freed = s3.freed)\n1388:    Repr tok L s3' s2 := by\n1404:/-- K3, K4: `Repr` carries over to the deallocation of the allocations `ids` when the places do\n1409:    (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (ids : List Nat) (au : Nat) (hP : s3'.P = s3.P)\n1422:    Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (deallocOps ids au)) := by\n1488:states are in `Repr`; hypotheses of `r1_read3`. -/\n1491:    (hwf : WF3 s3) (hnd : NoDangling s3) (hfl : FpLeaves s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2)\n1494:    AllOk C ObR ObW s2 (readOps s2 L ls) ∧ Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (readOps s2 L ls)) := by\n1509:the placement, has the outcome `ok`, and the arrival states are in `Repr`, for every geometry of\n1515:    {fa : Option Nat} {i : Nat} (hwf : WF3 s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (hwf2 : MM02.WF s2)\n1520:      Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 [.alloc (g i).space (pl s2 (g i)) (g i).size (g i).align fa]) := by\n1541:is unchanged and stays in `Repr`. -/\n1544:    {ls : List (Option Nat × Option Nat × Nat)} (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2)\n1546:    AllOk C ObR ObW s2 [] ∧ Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 []) := by\n1551:contracts, the deallocation has the outcome `ok` and the arrival states are in `Repr`. -/\n1554:    (hwf : WF3 s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (hfs : FreeSound k C L s3 s2 p auth)\n1557:      Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (deallocOps [rootAlloc L s3.P p] auth)) := by\n1592:chosen by the placement, have the outcome `ok`, and the arrival states are in `Repr`, for every\n1597:    (hwf : WF3 s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (hwf2 : MM02.WF s2) (hpl : PlacementOK pl)\n1601:      Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (allocOps pl g (some (tok s3.nF)) s2 (rootIdx ls))) := by\n1636:the outcome `ok`, and the arrival states are in `Repr`: owned storage that dies with the frame\n1640:    (hfo : FrameOwnedLive s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (htc : TokCompat C tok)\n1642:    AllOk C ObR ObW s2 (exitOps L tok s3) ∧ Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (exitOps L tok s3)) := by\n1727:states are in `Repr`. -/\n1730:    (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (h : NoStep k s3 s3') :\n1731:    AllOk C ObR ObW s2 [] ∧ Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 []) := by\n1734:      s'.I = s3.I → Repr tok L s' s2 := fun hP hF hd hfr hI =>\n1767:    (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (htc : TokCompat C tok) (h : ExitStep k s3 (.ok s3')) :\n1768:    AllOk C ObR ObW s2 (exitOps L tok s3) ∧ Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (exitOps L tok s3)) :=\n1773:/-- R4 (MM-03.3 §9.2, from `NoDangling`, §2.6): on a reached state of MM-03 in `Repr` with an MM-02\n1778:    {s2 : MM02.State} (hdd : DDSound k) (hr : Reachable k statics s3) (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) :\n1792:`Repr`), if an authority `a` has the effective mode `Modify` on a leaf `l`, no other authority `b`\n1810:Each verdict is checked by `decide` on the precondition of the MM-03 step and on `Repr`, which is","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"808fc224-8a98-4190-86d8-be022bcc9c45","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:00:18.937Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"      73\n7:Representation of the abstract states of MM-03.3 (module `Ern.MM03`) by the states of the abstract\n74:/-! ## Representation relation (K2, K3) -/\n91:/-- K3, relation of representation `Repr` between an MM-03 state `s3` and an MM-02 state `s2`, for\n105:`Repr` does not read the contracts `K`: no clause of K3 depends on them. -/\n106:structure Repr (tok : Nat → Nat) (L : Layout) (s3 : S3) (s2 : MM02.State) : Prop where\n127:    Decidable (Repr tok L s3 s2) :=\n369:/-! ## Transport of `Repr` -/\n377:/-- `Repr` carries over when the MM-02 state only keeps its allocations (`Dom`) and the MM-03 state\n380:theorem Repr.change {tok : Nat → Nat} {L : Layout} {s3 s3' : S3} {s2 s2' : MM02.State}\n381:    (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (hd : Dom s2 s2') (hP : s3'.P = s3.P) (hF : s3'.F = s3.F)\n385:    Repr tok L s3' s2' := by\n450:`ok`, and the states where those leaves are `Init` stay in `Repr`, under `dec` along the\n455:    ∀ (ls : List Nat) (s3 : S3) (s2 : MM02.State), Repr tok L s3 s2 →\n459:        Repr tok L (write3Eff s3 ls) (exec s2 (writeOps s2 L w ls))\n469:    have hR₁ : Repr tok L (write3Eff s3 [l]) s2₁ := by\n491:    · show Repr tok L _ (exec (Op2.eff _ s2) _); rw [e₁]; exact this.2\n651:/-- K2, K3: `Repr` carries over when new places, a shape appended after the old ones, receive one\n657:    {fa : Option Nat} (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (hwf : MM02.WF s2)\n668:    Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (allocOps pl g fa s2 (rootIdx ls))) :