{"parentUuid":"b51a2761-5677-4dfe-b2b6-98a47c3a5e75","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb5M8mZSmtJgKjWdMxi8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GuyYveMTecF2AVjfYMoPvG","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\"; cd .. && grep -rnE '\\b(sorry|admit|native_decide)\\b|^\\s*axiom\\b' --include='*.lean' --exclude-dir=.lake .; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 2, step 1: Repr with WF and provider tokens; freeSound_derived (L1-L5)\n\nWhy: arbitrages L3 (MM02.WF is a clause of Repr, no k) and L4 (token of\nan allocated root = its provider's, ghost provOf, FreeCompat instantiated\nby Compatible auth (ptok (provOf p)), freeSound_derived replaces the\nhypothesis FreeSound).\n\nWhat:\n- ReprB tok ptok provOf L s3 s2: the decidable K3 clauses plus\n  provTokens (the allocation of a root allocated from pr has token\n  ptok pr). Repr extends ReprB with wf2 : MM02.WF s2.\n- Transport lemmas (change, shrink, repr_deallocs, repr_extend) handle\n  provTokens; repr_extend takes the provider tokens of the new roots.\n- freeSound_derived: from provTokens and the instantiation FreeCompatInst.\n- R theorems restated on Repr: the MM02.WF hypotheses of r6_alloc and\n  r6_enter are dropped (now in Repr); r6_alloc uses the provider token\n  (L4) and keeps the one-root hypothesis (L2); r6_free takes the\n  instantiation of FreeCompat instead of FreeSound; r6_enter and\n  repr_init state that new automatic roots are not allocated roots.\n- Pass-1 cases and counterexamples ported; a wrong provider token is\n  rejected by ReprB.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; the 164\ntheorem constants use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit step 1 of pass 2"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":560,"cache_read_input_tokens":860775,"output_tokens":1008,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":145},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":560,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1008,"cache_read_input_tokens":860775,"cache_creation_input_tokens":560,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":560},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01GuyYveMTecF2AVjfYMoPvG":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && ~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\"; cd .. && grep -rnE '\\b(sorry|admit|native_decide)\\b|^\\s*axiom\\b' --include='*.lean' --exclude-dir=.lake .; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 2, step 1: Repr with WF and provider tokens; freeSound_derived (L1-L5)\n\nWhy: arbitrages L3 (MM02.WF is a clause of Repr, no k) and L4 (token of\nan allocated root = its provider's, ghost provOf, FreeCompat instantiated\nby Compatible auth (ptok (provOf p)), freeSound_derived replaces the\nhypothesis FreeSound).\n\nWhat:\n- ReprB tok ptok provOf L s3 s2: the decidable K3 clauses plus\n  provTokens (the allocation of a root allocated from pr has token\n  ptok pr). Repr extends ReprB with wf2 : MM02.WF s2.\n- Transport lemmas (change, shrink, repr_deallocs, repr_extend) handle\n  provTokens; repr_extend takes the provider tokens of the new roots.\n- freeSound_derived: from provTokens and the instantiation FreeCompatInst.\n- R theorems restated on Repr: the MM02.WF hypotheses of r6_alloc and\n  r6_enter are dropped (now in Repr); r6_alloc uses the provider token\n  (L4) and keeps the one-root hypothesis (L2); r6_free takes the\n  instantiation of FreeCompat instead of FreeSound; r6_enter and\n  repr_init state that new automatic roots are not allocated roots.\n- Pass-1 cases and counterexamples ported; a wrong provider token is\n  rejected by ReprB.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; the 164\ntheorem constants use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit step 1 of pass 2"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01GuyYveMTecF2AVjfYMoPvG":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"86366ac2-3907-42c5-b9b9-a4bdbe699491","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgb5M8HYv5bQsHwNxqKmh","requestRef":"6d70ccfd-635b-41b5-b117-6c0beac27240","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fba6dc88-d314-43d2-bc17-5e6a8d6f47c7","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:07:14.204Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
