{"parentUuid":"0c6ece6b-5205-473b-b63c-b5558599641a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb63APv1K8qkwkrZ2Sas","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FmwfWrqqigaykuhpa5DhMN","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\"; ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23/axcheck.lean; cd .. && grep -rnE '\\b(sorry|admit|native_decide)\\b|^\\s*axiom\\b' --include='*.lean' --exclude-dir=.lake .; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 2, step 4: pinned_address_stable (L8)\n\nWhy: L8 asks that every leaf pinned before an ok MM-03 step keep a live\nallocation and the same address after the step and its MM-02 sequence.\n\nWhat:\n- PinnedLive, step_pinned_usable, step_extends, step_pinnedLive,\n  reachable_pinnedLive: a pinned leaf (pin or K.Pinned) is usable on\n  reached states and stays usable across any ok step (proved in a scratch\n  workflow, verified independently).\n- step_isLeaf_old, Reachable.ofStep (Step and Reachable have the same\n  operations), exec_keeps_base (no MM-02 operation moves a registered\n  allocation, from a WF state).\n- leafAddr, pinned_address_stable: live before and after, same address;\n  the docstring says MM-02 models no physical move.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; all\ntheorem constants use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Build, check and commit step 4"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":963,"cache_read_input_tokens":925171,"output_tokens":741,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens"