{"parentUuid":"ba368d95-1302-4e98-8b45-1f69ba8dde40","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb6RAWipRrVmZcdMtq7Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015ot5s9B3GAp1ku7TttXdWS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\"; ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23/axcheck.lean; cd .. && grep -rnE '\\b(sorry|admit|native_decide)\\b|^\\s*axiom\\b' --include='*.lean' --exclude-dir=.lake .; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 2, step 5: simulation\n\nWhy: step 5 asks that every MM-03 execution from S3.init statics, with\nlayout, placement, tokens and pointer encoding fixed once, be simulated\nby an MM-02 run from the initial state of repr_init, all outcomes ok and\nRepr at each step.\n\nWhat:\n- Op3 (operations with their arguments, the bytes written included),\n  Step3 (ok step, envelope of L1: no owning element in enterFrame, L2:\n  one-root alloc), Exec3, Params (fixed once), assoc (K4/L6 sequences),\n  provStep (the ghost provOf, updated by alloc only), initOpsOf.\n- Trans: the canonical translation, total on executions (Trans.of_exec).\n- Oblig / SimRun: the translation whose own steps meet their obligations\n  (layout of new roots, dec along the sequence, FreeCompat instantiated by\n  the provider tokens); obligations bear on this run only.\n- simulation: along a SimRun, all MM-02 outcomes are ok, the run reaches\n  s2, Repr holds, the MM-03 state is reached; every prefix of a SimRun is\n  one, so this holds at each step. Remaining global hypotheses: DDSound,\n  stat, PlacementOK, alignments, TokCompat.\n- simulation_pinned (L8 along the run); pinned_address_stable now allows\n  the ghost to change across the step.\n- Reachable.ofStep, Step3.step, Exec3.reachable, SimRun.trans/exec3.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; all\ntheorem constants use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Build, check and commit step 5"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10487,"cache_read_input_tokens":949673,"output_tokens":1168,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":160},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10487,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1168,"cache_read_input_tokens":949673,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10487,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10487},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_015ot5s9B3GAp1ku7TttXdWS":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && ~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\"; ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23/axcheck.lean; cd .. && grep -rnE '\\b(sorry|admit|native_decide)\\b|^\\s*axiom\\b' --include='*.lean' --exclude-dir=.lake .; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 2, step 5: simulation\n\nWhy: step 5 asks that every MM-03 execution from S3.init statics, with\nlayout, placement, tokens and pointer encoding fixed once, be simulated\nby an MM-02 run from the initial state of repr_init, all outcomes ok and\nRepr at each step.\n\nWhat:\n- Op3 (operations with their arguments, the bytes written included),\n  Step3 (ok step, envelope of L1: no owning element in enterFrame, L2:\n  one-root alloc), Exec3, Params (fixed once), assoc (K4/L6 sequences),\n  provStep (the ghost provOf, updated by alloc only), initOpsOf.\n- Trans: the canonical translation, total on executions (Trans.of_exec).\n- Oblig / SimRun: the translation whose own steps meet their obligations\n  (layout of new roots, dec along the sequence, FreeCompat instantiated by\n  the provider tokens); obligations bear on this run only.\n- simulation: along a SimRun, all MM-02 outcomes are ok, the run reaches\n  s2, Repr holds, the MM-03 state is reached; every prefix of a SimRun is\n  one, so this holds at each step. Remaining global hypotheses: DDSound,\n  stat, PlacementOK, alignments, TokCompat.\n- simulation_pinned (L8 along the run); pinned_address_stable now allows\n  the ghost to change across the step.\n- Reachable.ofStep, Step3.step, Exec3.reachable, SimRun.trans/exec3.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; all\ntheorem constants use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Build, check and commit step 5"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_015ot5s9B3GAp1ku7TttXdWS":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"64828019-3b74-4d3a-a45b-2ce1766842e0","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgb6RAB8ZmCAskmNr4NWd","requestRef":"bccc0f5e-eded-43a8-8c78-7235017d940f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fe298add-c993-4a14-84fa-535002881624","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:21:17.521Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
