{"parentUuid":"d299995f-e3ca-40f1-9f66-c6806d99a712","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"afea6d65-2af9-420c-969b-b55d07c96f18","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ve2CabcCHuTSuPeuy5cDee","type":"tool_result","content":"Each verdict is obtained by `decide` on the precondition of the operation concerned. States are\nbuilt from `S3.init` by the effects of operations. Classification of each case (kernel,\nabstraction with `K` instantiated, out of kernel) is given in the report. -/\n\n/-- Test contracts: `SharedMutable`, `Pinned`, `ExternalDone`, `Deallocable` given by lists of\nleaves or places, `FreeCompat` by a list of pairs; no declared disjointness; every allocation\nsatisfiable. -/\ndef KT (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat)) : K :=\n  ⟨fun _ _ => False, (· ∈ sh), (· ∈ pinned), (· ∈ done), (· ∈ dealloc),\n    fun p a => (p, a) ∈ compat, fun _ _ _ => True⟩\n\nsection TestContracts\nvariable (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat))\ninstance : ∀ r r', Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).DeclaredDisjoint r r') :=\n  fun _ _ => instDecidableFalse\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).SharedMutable :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ sh))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Pinned :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ pinned))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).ExternalDone :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ done))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Deallocable :=\n  fun p => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (p ∈ dealloc))\ninstance : ∀ p a, Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).FreeCompat p a) :=\n  fun p a => inferInstanceAs (Decidable ((p, a) ∈ compat))\ninstance : ∀ p ls s, Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Satisfiable p ls s) :=\n  fun _ _ _ => instDecidableTrue\nend TestContracts\n\n/-- Empty contracts. -/\nabbrev K0 : K := KT [] [] [] [] []\n\ntheorem KT_dd (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat)) :\n    DDSound (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat) := fun _ _ h => h.elim\n\n/-- Entering frame 1 from the initial frame with locals `ls`. -/\n8761:def enter1 (ls : List (Option Nat × Option Nat × Nat)) : S3 := enterEff (S3.init []) [] ls\n8762-\n8763-/-! ### Case 1: two observations of a leaf (expected: allowed) -/\n8764-\n8765-def c1a : S3 := write3Eff (enter1 [(none, none, 0)]) [0]\n4385:inductive AllocStep (k : K) (provider owner : Nat) (ls : List (Option Nat × Option Nat × Nat))\n4386-    (s : S3) : AOutcome → Prop where\n4387-  | ok : AllocStatic k s provider owner ls → k.Satisfiable provider ls s →\n4388-      AllocStep k provider owner ls s (.ok (allocEff s provider owner ls))\n4389-  | fail : AllocStatic k s provider owner ls → ¬ k.Satisfiable provider ls s →\n4390-      AllocStep k provider owner ls s (.fail s)\n4391-  | reject : ¬ AllocStatic k s provider owner ls → AllocStep k provider owner ls s .reject\n4392-\n4393-/-- Determinism of `alloc` (B5). -/\n4394-theorem alloc_det {k : K} {pr ow : Nat} {ls : List (Option Nat × Option Nat × Nat)} {s : S3}\n4395-    {o₁ o₂ : AOutcome} (h₁ : AllocStep k pr ow ls s o₁) (h₂ : AllocStep k pr ow ls s o₂) :\n4396-    o₁ = o₂ := by\n4397-  cases h₁ <;> cases h₂ <;> first | rfl | contradiction\n1479:def ExitPre (k : K) (s : S3) : Prop :=\n1480-  match s.F with\n1481-  | _ :: F₀ => F₀ ≠ [] ∧\n1482-      (∀ q ∈ List.range s.P.length, ({ s with F := F₀ } : S3).Usable q →\n1483-        ∀ x ∈ s.D q, firstSurv s F₀ (x :: s.ancs x) ≠ none) ∧\n1484-      (∀ a ∈ List.range s.A.length, Survives s F₀ a → s.org a ≠ none →\n1485-        firstSurv s F₀ (s.ancs a) ≠ none) ∧\n1486-      (∀ q ∈ List.range s.P.length, s.Usable q → ¬ ({ s with F := F₀ } : S3).Usable q →\n1487-        ∀ l ∈ footprint s.P q, s.pin l = false ∧ ¬ k.Pinned l) ∧\n1488-      AnchorOrderHeld (exitEff s)\n1489-  | [] => False\n1490-\n1491-instance (k : K) [DecidablePred k.Pinned] (s : S3) : Decidable (ExitPre k s) := by\n1492-  unfold ExitPre; split <;> infer_instance\n1493-\n1494-/-- `exitFrame` as a relation (MM-03.3 §4, O7). -/\n1495-def ExitStep (k : K) (s : S3) : Outcome3 S3 → Prop := Guarded (ExitPre k s) (exitEff s)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"23c27a6b-02a9-4b7f-9208-89639985e8da","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:27:17.489Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Each verdict is obtained by `decide` on the precondition of the operation concerned. States are\nbuilt from `S3.init` by the effects of operations. Classification of each case (kernel,\nabstraction with `K` instantiated, out of kernel) is given in the report. -/\n\n/-- Test contracts: `SharedMutable`, `Pinned`, `ExternalDone`, `Deallocable` given by lists of\nleaves or places, `FreeCompat` by a list of pairs; no declared disjointness; every allocation\nsatisfiable. -/\ndef KT (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat)) : K :=\n  ⟨fun _ _ => False, (· ∈ sh), (· ∈ pinned), (· ∈ done), (· ∈ dealloc),\n    fun p a => (p, a) ∈ compat, fun _ _ _ => True⟩\n\nsection TestContracts\nvariable (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat))\ninstance : ∀ r r', Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).DeclaredDisjoint r r') :=\n  fun _ _ => instDecidableFalse\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).SharedMutable :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ sh))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Pinned :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ pinned))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).ExternalDone :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ done))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Deallocable :=\n  fun p => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (p ∈ dealloc))\ninstance : ∀ p a, Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).FreeCompat p a) :=\n  fun p a => inferInstanceAs (Decidable ((p, a) ∈ compat))\ninstance : ∀ p ls s, Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Satisfiable p ls s) :=\n  fun _ _ _ => instDecidableTrue\nend TestContracts\n\n/-- Empty contracts. -/\nabbrev K0 : K := KT [] [] [] [] []\n\ntheorem KT_dd (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat)) :\n    DDSound (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat) := fun _ _ h => h.elim\n\n/-- Entering frame 1 from the initial frame with locals `ls`. -/\n8761:def enter1 (ls : List (Option Nat × Option Nat × Nat)) : S3 := enterEff (S3.init []) [] ls\n8762-\n8763-/-! ### Case 1: two observations of a leaf (expected: allowed) -/\n8764-\n8765-def c1a : S3 := write3Eff (enter1 [(none, none, 0)]) [0]\n4385:inductive AllocStep (k : K) (provider owner : Nat) (ls : List (Option Nat × Option Nat × Nat))\n4386-    (s : S3) : AOutcome → Prop where\n4387-  | ok : AllocStatic k s provider owner ls → k.Satisfiable provider ls s →\n4388-      AllocStep k provider owner ls s (.ok (allocEff s provider owner ls))\n4389-  | fail : AllocStatic k s provider owner ls → ¬ k.Satisfiable provider ls s →\n4390-      AllocStep k provider owner ls s (.fail s)\n4391-  | reject : ¬ AllocStatic k s provider owner ls → AllocStep k provider owner ls s .reject\n4392-\n4393-/-- Determinism of `alloc` (B5). -/\n4394-theorem alloc_det {k : K} {pr ow : Nat} {ls : List (Option Nat × Option Nat × Nat)} {s : S3}\n4395-    {o₁ o₂ : AOutcome} (h₁ : AllocStep k pr ow ls s o₁) (h₂ : AllocStep k pr ow ls s o₂) :\n4396-    o₁ = o₂ := by\n4397-  cases h₁ <;> cases h₂ <;> first | rfl | contradiction\n1479:def ExitPre (k : K) (s : S3) : Prop :=\n1480-  match s.F with\n1481-  | _ :: F₀ => F₀ ≠ [] ∧\n1482-      (∀ q ∈ List.range s.P.length, ({ s with F := F₀ } : S3).Usable q →\n1483-        ∀ x ∈ s.D q, firstSurv s F₀ (x :: s.ancs x) ≠ none) ∧\n1484-      (∀ a ∈ List.range s.A.length, Survives s F₀ a → s.org a ≠ none →\n1485-        firstSurv s F₀ (s.ancs a) ≠ none) ∧\n1486-      (∀ q ∈ List.range s.P.length, s.Usable q → ¬ ({ s with F := F₀ } : S3).Usable q →\n1487-        ∀ l ∈ footprint s.P q, s.pin l = false ∧ ¬ k.Pinned l) ∧\n1488-      AnchorOrderHeld (exitEff s)\n1489-  | [] => False\n1490-\n1491-instance (k : K) [DecidablePred k.Pinned] (s : S3) : Decidable (ExitPre k s) := by\n1492-  unfold ExitPre; split <;> infer_instance\n1493-\n1494-/-- `exitFrame` as a relation (MM-03.3 §4, O7). -/\n1495-def ExitStep (k : K) (s : S3) : Outcome3 S3 → Prop := Guarded (ExitPre k s) (exitEff s)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5a54fe67-c70a-4dce-8393-849e4be4cdd5","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/refinement_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d299995f-e3ca-40f1-9f66-c6806d99a712","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
