{"parentUuid":"06111e6f-f23d-4584-8cb5-9bf33e9e6550","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb7YMfkeqv1xspv6chRB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BXmFX7MfTTHKVLxVt25jPS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep && git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 2, step 6: cases and a full simulated execution\n\nWhy: step 6 of the pass-2 brief asks for one witness per new operation and a\nfull execution (allocation, arena, emission, store, transfer to the caller,\nfree, frame exit) translated step by step.\n\nWhat:\n- CaseSim: an 18-step MM-03 execution from S3.init [] (enterFrame, write3,\n  alloc, write3, newArena, two derives, pin, enterFrame of a callee, issue,\n  store, transfer to the caller, exitFrame, endUse, reset, unpin, free,\n  exitFrame), built as SimRun prefixes with one Params fixed for the run;\n  simulation gives AllOk, the MM-02 state and Repr on every prefix.\n- Witnesses on the steps of the run: r6_issue, pointer_sound_issue (decode\n  104, provenance 4), pointer_sound_store (decode 8, provenance 0),\n  transfer_copies (pointer bytes copied to the caller with provenance 4),\n  r6_noStep for reset, simulation_pinned across the transfer; Repr fails\n  without the writes of issue or transfer.\n- L6: PtrEncOK (universal over addresses, satisfiable by no decode that\n  reads finitely many bytes) becomes the per-pointer PtrEncAt; no theorem\n  used PtrEncOK. pointer_sound_store and pointer_sound_issue state the L6\n  obligation (decode gives base + offset of the first leaf, each byte the\n  provenance of its allocation, live).\n- Decidable instances for NoOwner and LayoutObl.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean, no warnings; axiom sweep: 331 theorems of\nErn.MM23 within {propext, Quot.sound}; the 14 new examples checked the same\nway as theorems in a scratch copy; forbidden-word grep empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; git status --short","description":"Commit step 6","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":636,"cache_read_input_tokens":268469,"output_tokens":929,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":75},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":636,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":929,"cache_read_input_tokens":268469,"cache_creation_input_tokens":636,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":636},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01BXmFX7MfTTHKVLxVt25jPS":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep && git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 2, step 6: cases and a full simulated execution\n\nWhy: step 6 of the pass-2 brief asks for one witness per new operation and a\nfull execution (allocation, arena, emission, store, transfer to the caller,\nfree, frame exit) translated step by step.\n\nWhat:\n- CaseSim: an 18-step MM-03 execution from S3.init [] (enterFrame, write3,\n  alloc, write3, newArena, two derives, pin, enterFrame of a callee, issue,\n  store, transfer to the caller, exitFrame, endUse, reset, unpin, free,\n  exitFrame), built as SimRun prefixes with one Params fixed for the run;\n  simulation gives AllOk, the MM-02 state and Repr on every prefix.\n- Witnesses on the steps of the run: r6_issue, pointer_sound_issue (decode\n  104, provenance 4), pointer_sound_store (decode 8, provenance 0),\n  transfer_copies (pointer bytes copied to the caller with provenance 4),\n  r6_noStep for reset, simulation_pinned across the transfer; Repr fails\n  without the writes of issue or transfer.\n- L6: PtrEncOK (universal over addresses, satisfiable by no decode that\n  reads finitely many bytes) becomes the per-pointer PtrEncAt; no theorem\n  used PtrEncOK. pointer_sound_store and pointer_sound_issue state the L6\n  obligation (decode gives base + offset of the first leaf, each byte the\n  provenance of its allocation, live).\n- Decidable instances for NoOwner and LayoutObl.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean, no warnings; axiom sweep: 331 theorems of\nErn.MM23 within {propext, Quot.sound}; the 14 new examples checked the same\nway as theorems in a scratch copy; forbidden-word grep empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; git status --short","description":"Commit step 6","timeout":600000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"042450ff-6e86-4488-9875-cabd0b216949","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgb7YMCiacmfnbt4Zo64P","requestRef":"f7d88f66-b0f7-440d-a8b0-14c2cac8672c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d275797e-abdc-4002-9a61-cf771c1f6bfb","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:35:59.523Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
