{"parentUuid":"74d8428e-777b-4b12-80dd-24049e5cc5bb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb82VTqaVsrXvmeV69yj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BiKDGAn1RAHoqNyoDPd8H6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad; cat >> $SP/mm23/log.md <<'EOF'\n\n# ub-mode log — MM23 pass 2\n\n19. Saved the pass-2 brief summary to task_mm23_p2.md; stayed on formal/refinement_0.1. Why: brief §Git (\"même branche, à la suite\").\n20. Step 1 (9c08116): split Repr into decidable ReprB + Repr (WF clause, L3); added provTokens and the ghost provOf (L4); freeSound_derived replaces the FreeSound hypothesis of r6_free. Why: L3, L4. Found r6_enter needs no L1, so L1/L2 became an envelope of Step3 rather than hypotheses.\n21. Step 2 (cf09f12): transfer/store/issue sequences (L6), r6_transfer/r6_store/r6_issue, transfer_copies. Found r6_transfer holds without SameSizeAlong; only transfer_copies needs it, so it stays off r6_transfer and simulation (stronger statements).\n22. Step 3 (837a192): ddSound_of_layout. Found L7 literally false with zero-size leaves (K1 (d)); kept the counterexample with a LayoutWF witness; added the non-empty-range hypothesis and a report question.\n23. Step 4 (5fd6d8a): pinned_address_stable via PinnedLive on reached states and exec_keeps_base.\n24. Step 5 (10b837c): first draft quantified obligations over all translations (vacuity risk caught by self-review); rewrote as SimRun with per-run Oblig premises and Params fixed once; proved simulation and simulation_pinned.\n25. Step 6 (579808d): 18-step CaseSim run (alloc, arena, issue, store, transfer to caller, free, exits) as SimRun prefixes with an explicit ghost; witnesses for each new operation; negative Repr checks. Found PtrEncOK (universal) unsatisfiable by a finite decode; replaced by per-pointer PtrEncAt and added pointer_sound_store/issue for the L6 obligation. An unquoted heredoc once expanded backticks in docstrings: reverted the insertion and redid it with a quoted heredoc.\n26. Verified: build clean, 331 theorem constants and all 90 examples (renamed to theorems in a scratch copy) within {propext, Quot.sound}; forbidden-word grep empty.\n27. Adversarial review workflow launched: 5 lenses (L4, L6, L7, simulation, general) + one refuter per lens with findings. Why: brief §Règles and memory lesson (one reviewer per lens).\nEOF\ntail -3 $SP/mm23/log.md","description":"Append pass-2 entries to the ub-mode log"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1365,"cache_read_input_tokens":347907,"output_tokens":1195,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":79},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1365,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1195,"cache_read_input_tokens":347907,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1365},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01BiKDGAn1RAHoqNyoDPd8H6":{"command":"SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad; cat >> $SP/mm23/log.md <<'EOF'\n\n# ub-mode log — MM23 pass 2\n\n19. Saved the pass-2 brief summary to task_mm23_p2.md; stayed on formal/refinement_0.1. Why: brief §Git (\"même branche, à la suite\").\n20. Step 1 (9c08116): split Repr into decidable ReprB + Repr (WF clause, L3); added provTokens and the ghost provOf (L4); freeSound_derived replaces the FreeSound hypothesis of r6_free. Why: L3, L4. Found r6_enter needs no 