{"parentUuid":"009beb0a-c292-431e-a03b-14c6ef6112d1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e8b5e291-8f60-4fc9-8d4e-2bfcd70fe451","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B2tHMU1u9xpnmKd2cPNoqF","type":"tool_result","content":"import Ern.MM02\nimport Ern.MM03\n\n/-!\n# Refinement MM-03.3 v0.3 → MM-02 v0.4 (milestone 2, pass 1)\n\nRepresentation of the abstract states of MM-03.3 (module `Ern.MM03`) by the states of the abstract\nmachine of MM-02 (module `Ern.MM02`), and refinement of the operations in the scope of the\narbitrage K4 of the task. Both modules are imported unchanged; a lemma they lack is proved here.\n\nThe arbitrages K1–K5 of the task are cited as `K1`…`K5`. The rules of the specifications are cited\nas `MM-02.x` (MM-02 v0.4) and `MM-03.3 …` (MM-03.3 v0.3 révisée). Out of scope: `transfer`,\n`store`, `issue`, concurrency, real `DDSound`, stability of pinned addresses, low-level translation.\nThe decisions not dictated by the texts are listed in the report `formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md`,\nsection (c); the gaps between the drafts and their texts, section (f).\n-/\n\nnamespace Ern.MM23\n\n1373:theorem headD_mem_footprint {s : S3} (hwf : WF3 s) {r : Nat} (hr : r < s.P.length) :\n1384:  hlw.sameAlloc r hr.1 hr l hl _ (headD_mem_footprint hwf hr.1)\nErn/MM23.lean:1373:theorem headD_mem_footprint {s : S3} (hwf : WF3 s) {r : Nat} (hr : r < s.P.length) :\nErn/MM23.lean-1374-    (footprint s.P r).headD r ∈ footprint s.P r := by\nErn/MM23.lean-1375-  obtain ⟨l, hl⟩ := exists_leaf hwf s.P.length r (by omega) hr\nErn/MM23.lean-1376-  cases h : footprint s.P r with","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f69f2004-5b3c-4cdc-b242-5bfb51a411ee","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:58:40.874Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"import Ern.MM02\nimport Ern.MM03\n\n/-!\n# Refinement MM-03.3 v0.3 → MM-02 v0.4 (milestone 2, pass 1)\n\nRepresentation of the abstract states of MM-03.3 (module `Ern.MM03`) by the states of the abstract\nmachine of MM-02 (module `Ern.MM02`), and refinement of the operations in the scope of the\narbitrage K4 of the task. Both modules are imported unchanged; a lemma they lack is proved here.\n\nThe arbitrages K1–K5 of the task are cited as `K1`…`K5`. The rules of the specifications are cited\nas `MM-02.x` (MM-02 v0.4) and `MM-03.3 …` (MM-03.3 v0.3 révisée). Out of scope: `transfer`,\n`store`, `issue`, concurrency, real `DDSound`, stability of pinned addresses, low-level translation.\nThe decisions not dictated by the texts are listed in the report `formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md`,\nsection (c); the gaps between the drafts and their texts, section (f).\n-/\n\nnamespace Ern.MM23\n\n1373:theorem headD_mem_footprint {s : S3} (hwf : WF3 s) {r : Nat} (hr : r < s.P.length) :\n1384:  hlw.sameAlloc r hr.1 hr l hl _ (headD_mem_footprint hwf hr.1)\nErn/MM23.lean:1373:theorem headD_mem_footprint {s : S3} (hwf : WF3 s) {r : Nat} (hr : r < s.P.length) :\nErn/MM23.lean-1374-    (footprint s.P r).headD r ∈ footprint s.P r := by\nErn/MM23.lean-1375-  obtain ⟨l, hl⟩ := exists_leaf hwf s.P.length r (by omega) hr\nErn/MM23.lean-1376-  cases h : footprint s.P r with","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8795e479-0ecf-4e48-b040-6ee467f5a243","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/refinement_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"009beb0a-c