"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/MM23.lean","hunks":[{"oldStart":2455,"oldLines":7,"newStart":2455,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," /-- L6 (\"base + off of first leaf\"): address of the pointer to the region `rg`: base of the"," allocation of the first leaf of the list plus the offset of that leaf. It is the first byte of the","-region when that leaf has the lowest offset; K1 fixes no order of fields (report, (e) 3). -/","+region when that leaf has the lowest offset; K1 fixes no order of fields (pass-2 report, (e) 3). -/"," def regionAddr (s2 : MM02.State) (L : Layout) (rg : List Nat) : Nat :=","   match rg.head? with","   | some l => (((s2.allocs (L l).alloc).map (·.base)).getD 0) + (L l).off"]},{"oldStart":2576,"oldLines":8,"newStart":2576,"newLines":8,"lines":[" `l` of the list of the region of `a` (base + offset), and each carries the provenance of the"," allocation of `l`, which is live and contains the range of `l`; the range of `p` receives the first"," `(L p).len` of these bytes. Whether they are enough to decode the address depends on the size of","-`p` (report, (e) 4); whether `l` holds the first byte of the region, on the layout (report,","-(e) 3). -/","+`p` (pass-2 report, (e) 4); whether `l` holds the first byte of the region, on the layout","+(pass-2 report, (e) 3). -/"," theorem pointer_sound_store {C : Nat → Nat → Prop} {ObR : MM02.ReadOblSpec}","     {ObW : MM02.WriteOblSpec} {tok ptok : Nat → Nat} {provOf : Nat → Option Nat} {L : Layout}","     {s3 s3' : S3} {s2 : MM02.State} {pe : PtrEnc} {a p : Nat} (hwf : WF3 s3)"]},{"oldStart":2691,"oldLines":7,"newStart":2691,"newLines":7,"lines":["     DDSound { k with DeclaredDisjoint := ByteDisjoint L } :=","   ddSound_of_layout (fun _ _ h => h) fun _ _ _ l _ => hpos l"," ","-/-- Counterexample kept (report, (e)): with a leaf of size zero, allowed by K1 (d), the","+/-- Counterexample kept (pass-2 report, (e) 1): with a leaf of size zero, allowed by K1 (d), the"," instantiation of L7 declares a region disjoint from itself, and `DDSound` fails. -/"," theorem ddSound_of_layout_needs_size (k : K) :","     ¬ DDSound { k with DeclaredDisjoint := ByteDisjoint fun _ => ⟨0, 0, 0⟩ } := fun h =>"]},{"oldStart":4164,"oldLines":7,"newStart":4164,"newLines":7,"lines":[" example : ¬ ReprB π.tok π.ptok pvA L x10 n9 ∧ ¬ ReprB π.tok π.ptok pvA L x12 n11 := by","   decide"," ","-/-- Witness of question (e) 2 of the report, `issue`: `issue` of the empty region is `ok` in `x9`;","+/-- Witness of question (e) 2 of the pass-2 report, `issue`: `issue` of the empty region is `ok` in `x9`;"," the pointer that L6 writes has the provenance 4 of the arena storage, and the address 0, which L6"," does not define for an empty block. -/"," example : IssueAt KS 0 5 [] 7 x9"]},{"oldStart":4173,"oldLines":7,"newStart":4173,"newLines":7,"lines":["   ⟨.ok (ar := arS) (by decide) (.ok (by decide) (by decide) (by decide) (by decide)), rfl,","     fun _ => (by decide : arenaProv L x9 0 = some 4)⟩"," ","-/-- Witness of question (e) 2 of the report, `store`: `split 6 [[]]` gives the authority 10 of empty","+/-- Witness of question (e) 2 of the pass-2 report, `store`: `split 6 [[]]` gives the authority 10 of empty"," footprint (MM-03.3 O2 allows sub-regions of size zero), and `store 10 8` is `ok`; the pointer of"," the empty region has the address 0 and no provenance. -/"," def x10e : S3 := splitEff x10 6 [[]]"]},{"oldStart":4181,"oldLines":7,"newStart":4181,"newLines":7,"lines":["     x10e.afp 10 = [] ∧ regionAddr n10 L (x10e.afp 10) = 0 ∧ regionProv L (x10e.afp 10) = none :=","   ⟨.ok (by decide), .ok (by decide), by decide, by decide, by decide⟩"," ","-/-- Witness of question (e) 3 of the report: `issue` of the region `[6, 5]` (the leaves of `[5, 6]`)","+/-- Witness of question (e) 3 of the pass-2 report: `issue` of the region `[6, 5]` (the leaves of `[5, 6]`)"," is `ok`; the pointer has the address 112 of its first leaf 6, while the region begins at 104, the"," address of 5. Under the layout `Lsw`, which swaps the two fields (K1 fixes no order of fields) and"," satisfies `LayoutWF`, the region `[5, 6]` gives 112 while it begins at 104. -/"]},{"oldStart":4194,"oldLines":7,"newStart":4194,"newLines":7,"lines":[" example : LayoutWF Lsw x9 n9 ∧ regionAddr n9 Lsw [5, 6] = 112 ∧ leafAddr n9 Lsw 6 = 104 := by","   decide"," ","-/-- Witness of question (e) 4 of the report: under the layout `L0`, where the leaf 8 has size 0","+/-- Witness of question (e) 4 of the pass-2 report: under the layout `L0`, where the leaf 8 has size 0"," (K1 (d)), `ReprB` holds before `store 5 8`, the pointer written decodes to 8 as before, and the"," range of 8 receives no byte of it, while MM-03 makes 8 `Init` and lets it hold the authority 5. -/"," def L0 : Layout := fun q => if q = 8 then ⟨6, 0, 0⟩ else L q"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/MM23.lean"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"409ba560-e60d-4d5e-b11a-11be39b8e066","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/refinement_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f7da950b-e027-49ea-a6f6-aba69def3bd1","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","versi