t, `store`: `split 6 [[]]` gives the authority 10 of empty\nfootprint (MM-03.3 O2 allows sub-regions of size zero), and `store 10 8` is `ok`; the pointer of\nthe empty region has the address 0 and no provenance. -/\"\"\",\n\"\"\"/-- Witness of question (e) 2 of the pass-2 report, `store`: `split 6 [[]]` gives the authority 10\nof empty footprint (MM-03.3 O2 allows sub-regions of size zero), and `store 10 8` is `ok`; the\npointer of the empty region has the address 0 and no provenance. -/\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"/-- Witness of question (e) 3 of the pass-2 report: `issue` of the region `[6, 5]` (the leaves of `[5, 6]`)\nis `ok`; the pointer has the address 112 of its first leaf 6, while the region begins at 104, the\naddress of 5.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"/-- Witness of question (e) 3 of the pass-2 report: `issue` of the region `[6, 5]` (the leaves of\n`[5, 6]`) is `ok`; the pointer has the address 112 of its first leaf 6, while the region begins at\n104, the address of 5.\"\"\"),\n]\nfor a,b in R:\n    assert s.count(a)==1, a[:60]\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nlines=s.split('\\n')\nprint([ (i+1,len(l)) for i,l in enumerate(lines) if len(l)>100 and i>2400 and i<2700 or (len(l)>100 and i>3900)])\nPYEOF\nsed -n 4182,4205p Ern/MM23.lean","description":"Rewrap the long docstrings"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
