{"parentUuid":"7d8db857-3244-42c1-8183-489835c1b610","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb9g4nwvYq2TsSRdsMRr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JMJDB1kWtktsg2HdUir1eB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git status --short; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean formal/reports/MM23_v0.1_p2.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 2: review fixes and report\n\nWhy: the adversarial review of pass 2 (lenses L4, L6, L7, simulation,\ngeneral; one refuter per lens) confirmed 9 of 11 findings.\n\nWhat:\n- L6 issue: the provenance of the pointer is the allocation of the arena\n  storage, as L6 states (arenaProv, issueBytes; issueOps takes the MM-03\n  state and the arena index). issue_prov_storage proves, under ArenasInv,\n  that it is the allocation of every leaf of the block and of the storage;\n  pointer_sound_issue concludes it and takes ArenasInv (true on reached\n  states).\n- Docstrings: r6_transfer no longer lists SameSizeAlong; simulation says it\n  is not a hypothesis; pointer_sound_* no longer claim that the target range\n  holds the decoding bytes; regionAddr says it reads the first leaf of the\n  list; the module header covers pass 2; pass-2 report citations made\n  explicit.\n- CaseSim witnesses for the report questions: pointer of an empty region\n  (issue, and store after split into []), first leaf versus first byte\n  (region [6, 5], swapped layout), target leaf of size 0.\n- Report formal/reports/MM23_v0.1_p2.md, sections (a)-(f) and the review.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean, no warnings; 333 theorem constants of\nErn.MM23 and all 95 examples (renamed to theorems in a scratch copy) within\n{propext, Quot.sound}; forbidden-word grep empty; no new line over 100\ncharacters.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; git status --short","description":"Commit the review fixes and the report","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2168,"cache_read_input_tokens":454861,"output_tokens":1112,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":290},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2168,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1112,"cache_read_input_tokens":454861,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2168,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2168},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01JMJDB1kWtktsg2HdUir1eB":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git status --short; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean formal/reports/MM23_v0.1_p2.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 2: review fixes and report\n\nWhy: the adversarial review of pass 2 (lenses L4, L6, L7, simulation,\ngeneral; one refuter per lens) confirmed 9 of 11 findings.\n\nWhat:\n- L6 issue: the provenance of the pointer is the allocation of the arena\n  storage, as L6 states (arenaProv, issueBytes; issueOps takes the MM-03\n  state and the arena index). issue_prov_storage proves, under ArenasInv,\n  that it is the allocation of every leaf of the block and of the storage;\n  pointer_sound_issue concludes it and takes ArenasInv (true on reached\n  states).\n- Docstrings: r6_transfer no longer lists SameSizeAlong; simulation says it\n  is not a hypothesis; pointer_sound_* no longer claim that the target range\n  holds the decoding bytes; regionAddr says it reads the first leaf of the\n  list; the module header covers pass 2; pass-2 report citations made\n  explicit.\n- CaseSim witnesses for the report questions: pointer of an empty region\n  (issue, and store after split into []), first leaf versus first byte\n  (region [6, 5], swapped layout), target leaf of size 0.\n- Report formal/reports/MM23_v0.1_p2.md, sections (a)-(f) and the review.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean, no warnings; 333 theorem constants of\nErn.MM23 and all 95 examples (renamed to theorems in a scratch copy) within\n{propext, Quot.sound}; forbidden-word grep empty; no new line over 100\ncharacters.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; git status --short","description":"Commit the review fixes and the report","timeout":600000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b30650bb-b18b-4ddb-a2f9-2f070d76ae3d","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgb9g4N9RNBk8ZioBjsw3","requestRef":"f1753266-9ef4-4665-8098-20e5dfd0e4c8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7789d1ab-4cd4-4090-acb9-2182bdb9d008","timestamp":"2026-10-31T23:03:59.482Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
