{"parentUuid":"ef9076ea-a41c-4a4e-a48b-b155d20a6ee5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b5f18ae9-8acf-40c8-8b34-6556a60953e8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XNGPMSZz1rcmV7zutEGP9a","type":"tool_result","content":"2543:/-- R6 for `issue` (MM-03.3 §9.2, O18; L6: `WriteStep` of the range of the destination with\n2544-`ptrBytes` of the block; `available` and `issued` are abstract state of the arena entry): under\n2545-`WF3`, `dec` and `stat` (K5), the write has the outcome `ok`, the arrival states are in `Repr`, and\n2546-the range of the destination holds the bytes of the pointer. -/\n2547-theorem r6_issue {C : Nat → Nat → Prop} {ObR : MM02.ReadOblSpec} {ObW : MM02.WriteOblSpec}\n2456:/-- L6 (\"base + off of first leaf\"): address of the pointer to the region `rg`: base of the\n2457-allocation of the first leaf of the list plus the offset of that leaf. It is the first byte of the\n2458-region when that leaf has the lowest offset; K1 fixes no order of fields (pass-2 report,\n2459-(e) 3). -/\n2460-def regionAddr (s2 : MM02.State) (L : Layout) (rg : List Nat) : Nat :=","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d39728bd-c7b7-4fed-8123-d79a89546f0d","timestamp":"2026-10-31T23:21:02.551Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"2543:/-- R6 for `issue` (MM-03.3 §9.2, O18; L6: `WriteStep` of the range of the destination with\n2544-`ptrBytes` of the block; `available` and `issued` are abstract state of the arena entry): under\n2545-`WF3`, `dec` and `stat` (K5), the write has the outcome `ok`, the arrival states are in `Repr`, and\n2546-the range of the destination holds the bytes of the pointer. -/\n2547-theorem r6_issue {C : Nat → Nat → Prop} {ObR : MM02.ReadOblSpec} {ObW : MM02.WriteOblSpec}\n2456:/-- L6 (\"base + off of first leaf\"): address of the pointer to the region `rg`: base of the\n2457-allocation of the first leaf of the list plus the offset of that leaf. It is the first byte of the\n2458-region when that leaf has the lowest offset; K1 fixes no order of