PL-2, COMPL-3 confirmed; COMPL-1 refuted). Brief: ${SP}/task_mm23_p2.md.\nRead-only: do not modify any repository file. For Lean experiments write files under ${SP}/review3/ and run: cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean <file> (header \"import Ern.MM23\" then \"open Ern Ern.MM03 Ern.MM23\"; the build is up to date). Every finding needs evidence (quote, Lean check with output, or command output) from a check that would fail if the claim were false.`\n\nconst rev = await agent(`${CTX}\n\nCheck, for each confirmed finding, that the diff fixes it fully, and that every sentence the diff adds or changes is true of the module and the git history (names, counts, statements, hypotheses, classes in table (f), the account of both reviews). Report only real problems that remain or that the diff introduces. An empty list is a valid answer.`,\n  { label: 'check:fixes', phase: 'Check', schema: FINDINGS })\nif (!rev || rev.findings.length === 0) return { review: rev, verdicts: [] }\nconst v = await agent(`${CTX}\n\nA checker reported the findings below. Try to REFUTE each one; set real=false when the evidence does not hold up.\n\n${JSON.stringify(rev.findings, null, 2)}`, { label: 'verify:fixes', phase: 'Verify', schema: VERDICTS })\nreturn { review: rev, verdicts: v ? v.verdicts : null }\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1216,"cache_read_input_tokens":482378,"output_tokens":1551,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":122},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1216,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1551,"cache_read_input_tokens":482378,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1216,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_t