e` l'identification de la provenance. La plage de la cible reçoit","-      les `(L p).len` premiers octets du pointeur ;","-      rien ne lie cette taille à l'encodage, et une cible de taille nulle ne reçoit aucun octet","-      (question (e) 4).","+      les `(L p).len` premiers octets du pointeur ; rien ne lie cette taille à l'encodage, et une","+      cible de taille nulle ne reçoit aucun octet (question (e) 4)."," 11. **`issue` et `reset` (L6).** `available` et `issued` restent l'état abstrait de l'entrée d'arène.","     `reset` n'a pas de pas MM-02 (`NoStep.reset`, déjà en passe 1)."," 12. **L7.** L7, pris à la lettre, est faux : avec une feuille de taille nulle (K1 (d)), la"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/reports/MM23_v0.1_p2.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5b399a24-97c3-48bb-afed-105b889863a2","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/refinement_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f6cba7c7-d93e-4990-b63d-5a652aaf83c1","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
