{"parentUuid":"42706d2d-d6ce-43f1-ab90-c3189dc8249f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d8867bcf-fa69-4463-9401-ce9d6d53950a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CxHxeqLfz5bGY6dwKX76uK","type":"tool_result","content":"1:theorem Inv3.arenas {s : S3} (h : Inv3 s) (l : List Arena) : Inv3 { s with arenas := l } :=\n8:theorem ArenaInv.arenas {s : S3} {ar : Arena} (h : ArenaInv s ar) (l : List Arena) :\n11:/-- A kernel step changes no arena entry (D3). -/\n12:theorem KStep.arenas {k : K} {s s' : S3} (h : KStep k s s') : s'.arenas = s.arenas := by\n25:/-- A kernel step keeps the existing authorities, and activates none of them (MM-03.3 §3–5). -/\n26:theorem KStep.active_back {k : K} {s s' : S3} (h : KStep k s s') :\n42:/-- The arena invariant of another arena carries over to `issue` (D3): `issue` adds an authority\n44:theorem arenaInv_issue {s : S3} {ar ar₂ : Arena} {region : List Nat} {dst : Nat}\n55:/-- `arena.issue` on an entry of the state preserves `WF3`, `Inv3` and the arena invariants\n57:theorem issueAt_preserves {k : K} {s s' : S3} {i via dst : Nat} {region : List Nat}\n90:/-- `arena.reset` on an entry of the state preserves `WF3`, `Inv3` and the arena invariants\n92:theorem resetAt_preserves {k : K} {s s' : S3} {i via : Nat}\n118:/-- `arena_entry_follows_transfer` (D3; A4; F1): when the arena value, the place that holds\n121:theorem arena_entry_follows_transfer {k : K} {s s' : S3} {ar : Arena} {v dst : Nat}\n148:/-- `arena_dies_with_internal` (D3; A6; F1): after `endUse` of the arena value, the place that\n150:theorem arena_dies_with_internal {k : K} {s s' : S3} {ar : Arena} {v : Nat}\n/-- The arena invariant of another arena carries over to `issue` (D3): `issue` adds an authority\nand writes the metadata, and changes no place. -/\ntheorem arenaInv_issue {s : S3} {ar ar₂ : Arena} {region : List Nat} {dst : Nat}\n    (hai : ArenaInv s ar₂) : ArenaInv (issueEff s ar region dst).1 ar₂ := by\n  obtain ⟨yi, vi, hyi, -, hhi⟩ := hai.2.