{"parentUuid":"b5a82ee1-dd25-45c7-ab6a-1ef102b1acda","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d8867bcf-fa69-4463-9401-ce9d6d53950a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CHDvLJsKcLGaDtDHCp4dpP","type":"tool_result","content":"Each verdict is obtained by `decide` on the precondition of the operation concerned. States are\nbuilt from `S3.init` by the effects of operations. Classification of each case (kernel,\nabstraction with `K` instantiated, out of kernel) is given in the report. -/\n\n/-- Test contracts: `SharedMutable`, `Pinned`, `ExternalDone`, `Deallocable` given by lists of\nleaves or places, `FreeCompat` by a list of pairs; no declared disjointness; every allocation\nsatisfiable. -/\ndef KT (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat)) : K :=\n  ⟨fun _ _ => False, (· ∈ sh), (· ∈ pinned), (· ∈ done), (· ∈ dealloc),\n    fun p a => (p, a) ∈ compat, fun _ _ _ => True⟩\n\nsection TestContracts\nvariable (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat))\ninstance : ∀ r r', Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).DeclaredDisjoint r r') :=\n  fun _ _ => instDecidableFalse\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).SharedMutable :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ sh))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Pinned :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ pinned))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).ExternalDone :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ done))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Deallocable :=\n  fun p => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (p ∈ dealloc))\ninstance : ∀ p a, Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).FreeCompat p a) :=\n  fun p a => inferInstanceAs (Decidable ((p, a) ∈ compat))\ninstance : ∀ p ls s, Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Satisfiable p ls s) :=\n  fun _ _ _ => instDecidableTrue\nend TestContracts\n\n/-- Empty contracts. -/\nabbrev K0 : K := KT [] [] [] [] []\n\ntheorem KT_dd (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat)) :\n    DDSound (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat) := fun _ _ h => h.elim\n\n/-- Entering frame 1 from the initial frame with locals `ls`. -/\ndef enter1 (ls : List (Option Nat × Option Nat × Nat)) : S3 := enterEff (S3.init []) [] ls\n\n/-! ### Case 1: two observations of a leaf (expected: allowed) -/\n\ndef c1a : S3 := write3Eff (enter1 [(none, none, 0)]) [0]\n5468:def S3.init (statics : Statics) : S3 :=\n5469-  { F := [0]\n5470-    nF := 1\n5471-    P := shapeP [] (.frame 0) (statics.map (·.1))\n5472-    I := fun l => if ((statics[l]?).map (·.2)).getD false then .init else .uninit\n5473-    A := (rootIdx (statics.map (·.1))).map fun i =>\n5474-      ⟨.modify, none, footprint (shapeP [] (.frame 0) (statics.map (·.1))) i,\n5475-        shapeOwner (statics.map (·.1)) (.frame 0) i, true⟩\n5476-    D := fun _ => []\n5477-    dead := fun _ => false\n5478-    freed := fun _ => false\n5479-    pin := fun _ => false\n5480-    arenas := []\n5481-    callParams := fun _ => [] }\n5482-\n1988:theorem WF3.parts : ∀ (q : Nat) (pl : Place) (r : Nat), s.P[q]? = some pl → pl.parent = some r →\n2045:theorem WF3.parent_lt {s : S3} (hw : WF3 s) {i o : Nat} (h : parentOf s.P i = some o) :\n8316:theorem exists_mem_footprint {s : S3} (hw : WF3 s) :","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b93dc882-4533-48c5-86c6-f237b8785e7f","timestamp":"2026-11-01T17:31:39.218Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Each verdict is obtained by `decide` on the precondition of the operation concerned. States are\nbuilt from `S3.init` by the effects of operations. Classification of each case (kernel,\nabstraction with `K` instantiated, out of kernel) is given in the report. -/\n\n/-- Test contracts: `SharedMutable`, `Pinned`, `ExternalDone`, `Deallocable` given by lists of\nleaves or places, `FreeCompat` by a list of pairs; no declared disjointness; every allocation\nsatisfiable. -/\ndef KT (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat)) : K :=\n  ⟨fun _ _ => False, (· ∈ sh), (· ∈ pinned), (· ∈ done), (· ∈ dealloc),\n    fun p a => (p, a) ∈ compat, fun _ _ _ => True⟩\n\nsection TestContracts\nvariable (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat))\ninstance : ∀ r r', Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).DeclaredDisjoint r r') :=\n  fun _ _ => instDecidableFalse\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).SharedMutable :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ sh))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Pinned :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ pinned))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).ExternalDone :=\n  fun l => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (l ∈ done))\ninstance : DecidablePred (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Deallocable :=\n  fun p => inferInstanceAs (Decidable (p ∈ dealloc))\ninstance : ∀ p a, Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).FreeCompat p a) :=\n  fun p a => inferInstanceAs (Decidable ((p, a) ∈ compat))\ninstance : ∀ p ls s, Decidable ((KT sh pinned done dealloc compat).Satisfiable p ls s) :=\n  fun _ _ _ => instDecidableTrue\nend TestContracts\n\n/-- Empty contracts. -/\nabbrev K0 : K := KT [] [] [] [] []\n\ntheorem KT_dd (sh pinned done dealloc : List Nat) (compat : List (Nat × Nat)) :\n    DDSound (KT sh pinned done dealloc compat) := fun _ _ h => h.elim\n\n/-- Entering frame 1 from the initial frame with locals `ls`. -/\ndef enter1 (ls : List (Option Nat × Option Nat × Nat)) : S3 := enterEff (S3.init []) [] ls\n\n/-! ### Case 1: two observations of a leaf (expected: allowed) -/\n\ndef c1a : S3 := write3Eff (enter1 [(none, none, 0)]) [0]\n5468:def S3.init (statics : Statics) : S3 :=\n5469-  { F := [0]\n5470-    nF := 1\n5471-    P := shapeP [] (.frame 0) (statics.map (·.1))\n5472-    I := fun l => if ((statics[l]?).map (·.2)).getD false then .init else .uninit\n5473-    A := (rootIdx (statics.map (·.1))).map fun i =>\n5474-      ⟨.modify, none, footprint (shapeP [] (.frame 0) (statics.map (·.1))) i,\n5475-        shapeOwner (statics.map (·.1)) (.frame 0) i, true⟩\n5476-    D := fun _ => []\n5477-    dead := fun _ => false\n5478-    freed := fun _ => false\n5479-    pin := fun _ => false\n5480-    arenas := []\n5481-    callParams := fun _ => [] }\n5482-\n1988:theorem WF3.parts : ∀ (q : Nat) (pl : Place) (r : Nat), s.P[q]? = some pl → pl.parent = some r →\n2045:theorem WF3.parent_lt {s : S3} (hw : WF3 s) {i o : Nat} (h : parentOf s.P i = some o) :\n8316:theorem exists_mem_footprint {s : S3} (hw : WF3 s) :","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"76aa5f2b-3589-418a-a16f-778c2511db9b","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/validation_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b5a82ee1-dd25-45c7-ab6a-1ef102b1acda","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/validation_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
