{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","hash":"ede2313afedae1ae18a9388a2e6a17a0d953360175b0f85723f33729422ac4f7","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The runner and its soundness proofs compile. Testing it on the `PoolInv` counterexample scenario with `decide`."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012gDLmcS8WCHTy1c5mwdPVE","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && ~/.elan/bin/lake build Ern.HandlePool 2>&1 | tail -3; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad; cat > $SP/j3/cex.lean <<'EOF'\nimport Ern.HandlePool\nopen Ern.MM03 Ern.HandlePool\n\ndef opsA : List Op := [.enter [] [(none, none, 0), (none, none, 0), (none, none, 0)],\n  .write 0 [0], .write 1 [1], .alloc 0 1 [(none, none, 0), (some 3, none, 0), (some 3, none, 0)],\n  .newPool 3 3, .allocSlot 0 0 2, .resolve 0 ⟨0, 0, 0⟩ .modify]\ndef psA : PS := (prun K0 (PS.init []) opsA).getD (PS.init [])\ndef psB : PS := (prun K0 psA [.derive 4 5 .modify]).getD psA\n\nset_option maxRecDepth 4000 in\nexample : (prun K0 (PS.init []) opsA).isSome = true := by decide\nexample : PoolInv psA := by decide\nexample : (prun K0 psA [.derive 4 5 .modify]).isSome = true := by decide\nexample : ¬ PoolInv psB := by decide\nEOF\ntime ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean $SP/j3/cex.lean 2>&1 | head -20","description":"Build HandlePool and test the counterexample with decide","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
