{"parentUuid":"4a1d8625-8d03-4a7b-acf0-bf298851e463","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgceY6gD8esstXDLKaNKz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01McFk82mqdNR39BNiNygJHR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git status --short && git add formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3 step 2: MM3-H corpus, sections A to I and W1-W3\n\nWhy: the jalon-3 material (§1, §5b) asks for every MM3-H case replayed\nfrom the initial state, with its expected verdict from its source and a\npositive twin for each rejection.\n\nWhat: new module Ern.MM03.Horrors. Each case is a run of the extended\nmachine (HandlePool.prun) from S3.init, proved reached (run_reach), with\nthe verdict of the step under test stated with its operation's relation\nand decided on the reached state, plus its twin. Cases kept as obtained\nwhere they differ from the material's construction: H16 (a callee\ncannot receive a value by transfer: the parameter blocks it, O4.4),\nH07 (value made a callee local for the same reason), W2 (the column\nauthority of split also blocks the move), W3 (literal reading: reset\nstill rejected after the structure ends, blocks held by locals; the\nvariant issuing into the structure gives the expected verdicts). H01\nreborrow reading, resolveMany Observe rejection and the H42 expansion\nare kept as witnesses.\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; the 152 constants of the\nmodule depend only on propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad; cat >> $SP/j3/log.md <<'EOF'\n6. Step 2 done: MM3-H in Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean, 54 cases + J expansion, every state reached by\n   prun from S3.init. Findings: H16 not expressible (callee cannot move out of a parameter:\n   ActiveDerivedOutside); H07 rebuilt on a callee local; W2 column authority blocks the move; W3\n   literal reading gives reject after endUse of the structure (blocks held by locals); H51 view\n   makes v unwritable and un-endable until frame exit; H01 reborrow variant accepted.\nEOF","description":"Commit step 2 and log","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":800,"cache_read_input_tokens":578446,"output_tokens":1006,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":63},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":800,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1006,"cache_read_input_tokens":578446,"cache_creation_input_tokens":800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":800},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01McFk82mqdNR39BNiNygJHR":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git status --short && git add formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3 step 2: MM3-H corpus, sections A to I and W1-W3\n\nWhy: the jalon-3 material (§1, §5b) asks for every MM3-H case replayed\nfrom the initial state, with its expected verdict from its source and a\npositive twin for each rejection.\n\nWhat: new module Ern.MM03.Horrors. Each case is a run of the extended\nmachine (HandlePool.prun) from S3.init, proved reached (run_reach), with\nthe verdict of the step under test stated with its operation's relation\nand decided on the reached state, plus its twin. Cases kept as obtained\nwhere they differ from the material's construction: H16 (a callee\ncannot receive a value by transfer: the parameter blocks it, O4.4),\nH07 (value made a callee local for the same reason), W2 (the column\nauthority of split also blocks the move), W3 (literal reading: reset\nstill rejected after the structure ends, blocks held by locals; the\nvariant issuing into the structure gives the expected verdicts). H01\nreborrow reading, resolveMany Observe rejection and the H42 expansion\nare kept as witnesses.\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; the 152 constants of the\nmodule depend only on propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad; cat >> $SP/j3/log.md <<'EOF'\n6. Step 2 done: MM3-H in Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean, 54 cases + J expansion, every state reached by\n   prun from S3.init. Findings: H16 not expressible (callee cannot move out of a parameter:\n   ActiveDerivedOutside); H07 rebuilt on a callee local; W2 column authority blocks the move; W3\n   literal reading gives reject after endUse of the structure (blocks held by locals); H51 view\n   makes v unwritable and un-endable until frame exit; H01 reborrow variant accepted.\nEOF","description":"Commit step 2 and log","timeout":300000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"15e8b24a-8756-4482-9b11-55015668cbf0","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgceY6R667XrWEMtx3Kx4","requestRef":"b879028c-5757-44ae-acf6-69544e9906f2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5550844b-c1bc-4067-91a0-bcd2dbcd2ed3","timestamp":"2026-11-01T18:03:04.976Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/validation_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
